@startuml
title Plane State Transition Diagram

state Order
state Arrival
state Preparation
state Operations
state Maintenance
state Retired
state Removed

[*] --> Order : New plane acquired

Order --> Arrival : Delivered

Arrival --> Preparation : Arrival complete

Preparation --> Operations : Ready for operations
Preparation --> Maintenance : Requires maintenance

Operations --> Maintenance : No more flights or maintenance needed

Maintenance --> Preparation : Servicing completed

Operations --> Retired : Plane taken out of service

Retired --> Removed : Permanently withdrawn

@enduml
